e were independently reproduced during FAC/Polypeptone triage. They supplement the W06 ten-union seven-entry list; they are not a new peer finding ID or an exhaustive campaign count.\n\n- TARGET-009 `Ferric_Ammonium_Citrate.yaml`, SHA256 `70f3b34f5cddc485f53242cd6f04ff1bc9fd6598e2be906f6da89393af8f2234`, `/ontology_mapping/evidence/1`: MANUAL_CURATION, source `all_unmatched_20261107 worker04 primary proposal ferric-ammonium-citrate`.\n- TARGET-019 `Polypeptone.yaml`, SHA256 `13e635961c13a15555bc3b526c7f83e0af148c2dc87a23ff0a273cace16f3b93`, `/ontology_mapping/evidence/0`: MANUAL_CURATION, source the Thermo peptone technical-reference-guide URL.\n\nEach entry is absent from its authentic beforeimage and linked to added agent/LLM-assisted proposal history. Use the honest evidence or interpretation category warranted by its content, retaining sources, histories and scientific limitations. This neither changes ComponentEvidenceTypeEnum nor grants identity/role/export approval. Preserve the original W07 native review, which did not assign a separate finding ID to these entries; this is an independent reproduction under already-filed #1226. Exact entries and added history are in `C/preflight/fac-polypeptone-findings-triage-v1/native-reproduction.json`.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6718777633/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"pin":null}